{"id": "EUVD-2026-87229", "enisaUuid": "b5a9f379-0f43-30da-9021-f996101ebb16", "description": "RabbitMQ is a messaging and streaming broker. From 3.13.0 until 3.13.18, 4.0.23, 4.1.14, 4.2.9, and 4.3.3, native MQTT and MQTT over WebSocket behind a trusted PROXY Protocol frontend could lose the proxy-derived client address before the MQTT authentication path checked loopback_users, causing the frontend-to-broker address to be treated as loopback. An attacker who can reach the trusted frontend and has valid credentials for a loopback-restricted account can therefore bypass the source-address restriction; the issue does not bypass password authentication. This issue is fixed in versions 3.13.18, 4.0.23, 4.1.14, 4.2.9, and 4.3.3.", "datePublished": "2026-09-25T16:26:33", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-25T16:55:42", "baseScore": 6.0, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:P/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/rabbitmq/rabbitmq-server/security/advisories/GHSA-4r6f-9cpw-f6g6", "https://github.com/rabbitmq/rabbitmq-server/commit/a7528314840c4f8dc9904684f9f97ffa7aac6349", "https://github.com/rabbitmq/rabbitmq-server/commit/edbead0eabbd65925d0dc914a22d6a29e155e646", "https://github.com/rabbitmq/rabbitmq-server/releases/tag/v4.2.9", "https://github.com/rabbitmq/rabbitmq-server/releases/tag/v4.3.3"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-67411"], "assigner": "GitHub_M", "epss": 0.32, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "2310368f-6de4-3925-982b-4f54044fb60f", "product": {"name": "rabbitmq-server", "vendor": {"name": "rabbitmq"}}, "product_version": "4.1.0, < 4.1.14"}, {"id": "8b44c803-a0ab-353e-ae43-71fe8a8a71e6", "product": {"name": "rabbitmq-server", "vendor": {"name": "rabbitmq"}}, "product_version": "4.3.0, < 4.3.3"}, {"id": "8c41d336-8ee8-397b-903a-1322aac606af", "product": {"name": "rabbitmq-server", "vendor": {"name": "rabbitmq"}}, "product_version": "3.13.0, < 3.13.18"}, {"id": "af8a094a-4345-3909-9bb5-5cd4028fc200", "product": {"name": "rabbitmq-server", "vendor": {"name": "rabbitmq"}}, "product_version": "4.2.0, < 4.2.9"}, {"id": "e8987c27-0288-3f7b-93f6-451f31916d9d", "product": {"name": "rabbitmq-server", "vendor": {"name": "rabbitmq"}}, "product_version": "4.0.0, < 4.0.23"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "6a7a11d2-f0d2-3c0f-8a65-e6c6e3c0c746", "vendor": {"name": "rabbitmq"}}], "isExploited": false}